PARSFILE
#FullDataName Events`CCRm,s A. Wait for ACC to Intervene`Euro NCAP ACC Testing
#CheckBox1 1    
*CLEAR
#CheckBox6 0    
#CheckBox7 0    
#CheckBox9 0    
