#RingCtrl0 <
#RingCtrl10 1
#RingCtrl11 4
RESET_EVENTS
*NAME1 minACC_Gain
*NAME2 Contact
*VALUE1 1
*VALUE2 0
#BlueLink10 ` , Miscellaneous` , Miscellaneous` , Miscellaneous`

MAKE_EVENT minACC_Gain < 1 ; Events\Events_2fb4d6a5-ba98-4152-9fd5-fbcfed0c7be7.par
#BlueLink0 Events`CCRm,s B. Monitor Braking Progress, ACC` Euro NCAP ACC Testing` , Events`Events_2fb4d6a5-ba98-4152-9fd5-fbcfed0c7be7

