#EMBEDDED_NOTES
#Check to see if the ACC system has requested a speed decrease
#- The ACC System requests a speed decrease to the ego vehicle speed controller by changing the speed controller gain
#- minACC_Gain is the gain sent to the speed  controller, from the ACC system
#
#END_EMBEDDED_NOTES

